digraph account_payable_process_50 {
	graph [rankdir=LR]
	START_NODE [label="" shape=circle width=0.3]
	subgraph CLUSTER_0 {
		"send to the receiving department" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" [shape=box]
		"send to the receiving department" -> "create a receiving report"
		"double check a three-way match" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" -> "double check a three-way match"
		"OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_VA3H" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"double check a three-way match" -> "OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_VA3H"
		"store in paid invoice file" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_VA3H" -> "store in paid invoice file"
		"enter the invoice into the accounts payable account" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_VA3H" -> "enter the invoice into the accounts payable account"
		"check dates to avoid penalty charges" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_VA3H" -> "check dates to avoid penalty charges"
		"schedule the payment" [shape=box]
		"enter the invoice into the accounts payable account" -> "schedule the payment"
		"OR_JOIN--4. Payment_VA3H" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"store in paid invoice file" -> "OR_JOIN--4. Payment_VA3H"
		"schedule the payment" -> "OR_JOIN--4. Payment_VA3H"
		"check dates to avoid penalty charges" -> "OR_JOIN--4. Payment_VA3H"
	}
	START_NODE -> "send to the receiving department"
	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"OR_JOIN--4. Payment_VA3H" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The text below is about the account payable process. It begins when you send to the receiving department. 
Once sending to the receiving department occurs, creating a receiving report needs to be done. 
When creating a receiving report is completed, you need to double check a three-way match.
Once doubling check a three-way match occurs, one or more of the following paths should be executed: storing in paid invoice file, entering the invoice into the accounts payable account, checking dates to avoid penalty charges. 
After entering the invoice into the accounts payable account, scheduling the payment should be done. 
The process is now completed. 
"
}
